        "original_id": "464b9fae-b32c-552c-ab0e-72bba9c2eb1b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jay Park, Sol Kyung-gu, Jung Woo-sung, Han Hyo-joo, Jin Kyung, Lee Junho\n- Music Groups: 2PM\n- Products: Ultra Lover, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\", Go Crazy, Cold Eyes\n- Places: Makuhari Messe\n\nFacts:\n- Jay Park officially left 2PM in early 2010.\n- The live DVD 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\" is by 2PM.\n- The single Ultra Lover was released along with 2PM's second live DVD 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\" in Makuhari Messe.\n- Cold Eyes is a 2013 South Korean film starring Sol Kyung-gu, Jung Woo-sung, Han Hyo-joo, Jin Kyung, and Lee Junho.\n- Go Crazy is the fourth Korean studio album and seventh overall album by the South Korean boy band 2PM.",
